@startuml RF27_Sequencia_Organizar
title RF27 — Meu Quarto (guarda-roupa num quarto 3D interativo)\nDiagrama de sequência — organizar com IA, desfazer e endereço automático da peça nova
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor "Pessoa" as U
participant "room/page.tsx" as FE
participant "RoomController" as C
participant "RoomService" as S
participant "AiEngine\n(motor de IA, RF24)" as AI
participant "AiProviderPort\n(Claude / Gemini)" as P
participant "WardrobeEventListeners" as WL
participant "FaiPointsService" as FP
participant "InventoryScoreService" as ISS
database "MySQL" as DB

== Prévia da organização ==
U -> FE: Organizar (com IA)
FE -> C: GET /api/me/room/organization/preview?useAi=true
C -> S: organizePreview(user, true)
S -> DB: SELECT room_layouts, room_storage_map, wardrobe_items
S -> S: suggestLabel(): rótulo local pela categoria dominante
S -> AI: text(TextCall(COPILOT, gavetas e subcategorias))
AI -> AI: cota (RateLimitPort), consentimento, teto de gasto
alt provedor disponível
  AI -> P: gera {"labels": {...}}
  P --> AI: texto
  AI --> S: AiOutcome(rótulos validados, ≤ 24 caracteres)
else sem provedor, cota ou resposta inválida
  AI --> S: AiOutcome(fallback local, fallbackUsed = true)
end
S -> S: mantém peças coerentes; place() para as demais
S --> FE: 200 {labels, changedLabels, moves, summary,\nfallbackUsed, explanation, canUndo}
note right of FE: a prévia não grava nada

== Aplicar ==
U -> FE: Aplicar
FE -> C: POST /api/me/room/organization {labels, moves}
C -> S: applyOrganization(user, labels, moves)
S -> DB: UPDATE room_layouts (previous_map_json,\ndrawer_labels_json com source = AI)
S -> DB: UPDATE room_storage_map (assigned_by = AI)
S -> ISS: RoomOrganized → invalidate (limpa o cache da nota)
S --> FE: 200 {applied, labels, canUndo}
S ->> WL: RoomOrganized (AFTER_COMMIT, SideEffectRunner)
WL -> FP: award(userId, "ROOM_ORGANIZED", "ROOM", null)
FP -> DB: INSERT fai_points_ledger (+20; teto semanal 1)

== Desfazer ==
U -> FE: Desfazer
FE -> C: DELETE /api/me/room/organization
C -> S: undoOrganization(user)
alt previous_map_json vazio
  S --> FE: 409 NADA_A_DESFAZER
else há mapa anterior
  S -> DB: UPDATE room_layouts (rótulos anteriores, previous_map_json = null)
  S -> DB: UPDATE room_storage_map (endereços anteriores, assigned_by = USER)
  S --> FE: 200 {restored, labels}
end

== Peça nova ganha endereço sozinha ==
note over S, DB: WardrobeService.create publica PieceCreated (RF4)
S -> S: onPieceCreated (AFTER_COMMIT) → SideEffectRunner\n"quarto:PieceCreated" → autoAssign(userId, pieceId)
S -> DB: INSERT room_storage_map (assigned_by = AUTO)
note right of S: falha aqui não desfaz o cadastro da peça;\nPieceDeleted → deleteByWardrobeItemId
@enduml
